# ============================================================
# CbetaZenTranslations – Local application artifacts (CBETA Translator)
# ============================================================

# --- Local markdown working copies (never commit these) ---
md-p5t/

# --- Translation cache ---
xml-p5t-cache/

# --- All index-related files (search + debug + caches) ---
# Anything containing "index" in filename
*index*

# Explicitly listed (for clarity)
index.cache.json
index.debug.log
search.index.bin
search.index.bin.tmp

# --- Generic cache / temp artifacts ---
*.tmp
*.temp
*.log
*.cache
*.bak

# --- OS junk ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# --- Editor junk ---
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo

# --- Build / runtime junk ---
bin/
obj/

# --- Local generated reference TM ---
translation-memory.reference.jsonl
xml-p5t-safety-backup/

# ── Published index artifacts the WEBSITE depends on ─────────────────────
# The blanket *index* rule above was written for SEARCH indexes. It has been
# silently swallowing every published index the site fetches -- which is why the
# front page's community section has been invisible since launch (it 404s on
# community/INDEX.json and hides itself) and why master pages had to guess their
# shard filenames. These are data, not caches. Keep them.
!termbase.index.json
!community/INDEX.json
!corpus/masters/_index.json
